Ica
$cards
DECK 2 SPADES

$initial
BOBE 9 FACE_ALL
BOBE 9 FACE_ALL
BOBE 8 FACE_LAST
BOBE 0 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE BOBE BOBE
OR
    SRC Suit {HEARTS, CLUBS, SPADES}
    DEST Suit {SPADES, DIAMONDS}
MOVE_STACK BOBE BOBE
SRCSTACK Size <= 6
$win
AND
    PILE ALL BOBE Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL BOBE Empty
        PILE ALL BOBE Empty
